.Dd February 3, 2026
.Dt PORT-MATROID.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm port-matroid.conf
.Nd configuration file for port-matroidd
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm is a line-oriented key=value configuration file.
Blank lines and lines beginning with .Sq # are ignored.
Unknown keys are rejected.
.Sh KEYS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic data_dir
State directory (snapshots and WAL).
.It Ic listen
Network listen address, e.g. .Dq 0.0.0.0:7000 .
.It Ic control_socket
UNIX control socket path.
.It Ic max_frame_bytes
Maximum accepted network frame size.
.It Ic tick_ms
Tick interval in milliseconds.
.It Ic log_format
Either .Dq text or .Dq json .
.It Ic log_level
One of .Dq debug , .Dq info , .Dq warn , .Dq error .
.It Ic readonly
Boolean: .Dq true or .Dq false .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# /etc/port-matroid/port-matroid.conf
data_dir=/var/lib/port-matroid
listen=0.0.0.0:7000
control_socket=/run/port-matroid/control.sock
max_frame_bytes=1048576
tick_ms=250
log_format=json
log_level=info
readonly=false
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr port-matroidd 1 ,
.Xr port-matroidctl 1
